=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Mertaire} in {z:Lower Jeuno}, who tells you to take the {p:Star ring (tarnished)} to an antique collector.
** Quest wont be listed in log yet.
* Speak to {n:Imasuke} (E-6) in {z:Port Jeuno}.
** You must have your current job set to {p:Bard} to receive the cutscene.
** **After speaking with him, you may change to any job.**
* Travel to (I-10) in {z:Xarcabard} and examine the **Perennial Snow** at the end of the short tunnel.
** You must now wait one Earth minute before you can retrieve the ring.
* Retrieve the {p:Star ring (indecipherable)} by examining the **Perennial Snow**.
* Go back to {n:Imasuke} who tells you to find someone who can translate the ring.
* Head to {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} and speak to {n:Chalvatot} at (F-7) to receive the {p:Moon ring}.
* Listen to his instructions and travel to {z:Monastic Cavern} via {z:Davoi} @ (H-11)
* Walk to the small circular room at (I-8) with the altar in it
** Be careful of the True Sight {m:Orcish Warlord} that roams the area
* After clearing the {m:Orcs|Orc}, examine the altar to spawn {m:Bugaboo}
* Defeat him, then examine the altar again for a cutscene.
* Return and speak to {n:Chalvatot} for your reward, and to complete the quest.

